# .gitignore for the installed watchdog directory (~/watchdog).
# install.sh copies this file there as .gitignore and initialises a Git
# repo, so every change to the evolution layer is a commit with a
# justification, and a bad change can be reverted. Logs, the live config
# and runtime data are never committed.
*.log
*.lock
watchdog.conf
last-reasoning.txt
incidents.log
events.log
proposals.md
hypotheses.tsv
